  "name": "Uncle Howie's Favorite Artichoke Dip",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Cheesy, creamy dip loaded with artichokes and garlic! Serve with toasted french bread slices for a fantastic appetizer. To serve the dip hot, transfer to a medium baking dish and heat at 375 degrees F (190 degrees C) for 20 minutes, or until bubbling and slightly browned.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a medium bowl, mix the cream cheese, artichoke hearts, mayonnaise, garlic, red bell pepper, Swiss cheese and green onions."
    }
